<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Ye Chiu debuts at 15.80 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Ye Chiu debuts at 15.80 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Ye Chiu Metal Smelting Bhd made their market debut at 15.80 ringgit against an offer price of 4.00.</p>
<p>The aluminium alloy manufacturer offered 3.06 million shares for its listing on the Second Board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>Around two minutes into the opening, the stock was at 14.30 ringgit on a volume of 166,000 traded.</p>
<p>Ye Chiu forecast net earnings per share of 49.94 cents for the year ended June 30, 1997. At 15.80 ringgit, price-to-earnings ratio is 31.6 times.</p>
</text>
